# The scenes of the old-command-line-programs deck, in order. Each "## Scene N: title" is one slide, spoken with item N of
# old-command-line-programs.narration.md. Each line under a heading puts one thing on the slide:
#   note "<text>"         a line of text
#   show <file> ...       a code panel: <from> <to> or /pattern/, then a label; --mark and --zoom mark lines
#   run_live "<command>"  a live run, played from its cast in old-command-line-programs.outputs/
#   callout "<text>"      a boxed sentence saying what a result means

## Scene 1: step 1, the version catalogue
note "Step 1: add System Stubs to the version catalogue."
show libs.versions.toml "/system-stubs/" gradle/libs.versions.toml

## Scene 2: step 2, the test dependency
note "Step 2: add it as a test dependency of the lesson."
show lessons/old-command-line-programs/example/build.gradle.kts "/^dependencies/" "lesson build file" --zoom 9

## Scene 3: step 3, the agent for environment variables
note "Step 3: give the test process the *agent* System Stubs uses for environment variables, when it starts."
show lessons/old-command-line-programs/example/build.gradle.kts "/^tasks.test/" "lesson build file" --zoom 18-19

## Scene 4: the code under test
note "The code under test: today's program. An *environment variable*, *standard input*, printing, and *System.exit*."
show TodaysPaymentImport 15 31 "today's program" --zoom 25

## Scene 5: the weak tests
note "The *weak* tests: the pieces, one at a time. They never run the program."
show PaymentLineTest 13 30 "tests of the pieces"

## Scene 6: the strong test, its stubs
note "The *strong* test runs the whole program. System Stubs sets the environment, the input and the output."
show PaymentImportTest 19 28 "the strong test" --zoom 22-28

## Scene 7: the strong test, one test
note "One test: a limit of 2000 paise, and three payments. The second is over the limit."
show PaymentImportTest 40 48 "one strong test" --zoom 42-44

## Scene 8: today's program stops the test run
note "Run the tests against today's program:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:old-command-line-programs:test -Pcode=today"
callout "System Stubs ran today's program unchanged, until its System.exit stopped the whole test run."

## Scene 9: the program given its exit
note "The program after one small change: it is *given* how to print and how to end."
show PaymentImport 17 31 "the program, given its exit" --zoom 20,30

## Scene 10: every test passes
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:old-command-line-programs:test"
callout "Same tests: environment, input and output stubbed by System Stubs, and the exit passed in. Every test passes."
